# Third pull of the same cell (mode=battleground map=flags spec=druid:
# restoration style=auto view=844x390,touch save=carried), run all the way to
# the match's own end this time. -29 and -30 both showed the same shape: a
# stationary AUTO healer spends most of a heal slot's time reading "range"
# (out of range of anyone to heal), dies at least once, and casts only a
# handful of times in two minutes (power drained ~100-300 of 1000). This run
# chunks play() in shorter 40s windows with a short wait between, so a death
# mid-chunk costs less of the observation, through to Ebb and Flow's own
# 180s limit (#278).
open
tap battleground
tap map:flags
tap class:druid:restoration
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state

play auto 40
state
bill

wait 3
play auto 40
state
bill

wait 3
play auto 40
state
bill

wait 3
play auto 40
state
bill

wait 3
play auto 40
shot end
state
bill
says
targets
